('What did Aaron make for the people to worship while Moses was on the mountain?', ARRAY['A silver snake', 'A wooden pole', 'A golden calf', 'A stone altar'], 'A golden calf', 'Exodus 32:4 - ...he made it into an idol cast in the shape of a calf.', 'Pentateuch', 'Easy'),
('Which tribe of Israel was set apart for the priesthood?', ARRAY['Judah', 'Levi', 'Benjamin', 'Reuben'], 'Levi', 'Numbers 3:6 - "Bring the tribe of Levi and present them to Aaron the priest."', 'Pentateuch', 'Medium'),
('Who was chosen to succeed Moses as leader of Israel?', ARRAY['Caleb', 'Joshua', 'Eleazar', 'Aaron'], 'Joshua', 'Numbers 27:18 - So the Lord said to Moses, "Take Joshua son of Nun... and lay your hand on him."', 'Pentateuch', 'Medium'),
('How many spies were sent to explore the land of Canaan?', ARRAY['2', '10', '12', '7'], '12', 'Numbers 13:1-16 - Moses sent twelve leaders, one from each tribe.', 'Pentateuch', 'Medium'),
('Which two spies gave a good report of the Promised Land?', ARRAY['Moses and Aaron', 'Joshua and Caleb', 'Judah and Levi', 'Reuben and Simeon'], 'Joshua and Caleb', 'Numbers 14:6-7 - Joshua son of Nun and Caleb son of Jephunneh... said... "The land we passed through... is exceedingly good."', 'Pentateuch', 'Medium'),
('How many years did the Israelites wander in the desert?', ARRAY['7', '12', '40', '100'], '40', 'Numbers 14:34 - "For forty years... you will suffer for your sins."', 'Pentateuch', 'Easy'),
('What animal spoke to the prophet Balaam?', ARRAY['A lion', 'A donkey', 'A sheep', 'A camel'], 'A donkey', 'Numbers 22:28 - Then the Lord opened the donkey''s mouth, and it said to Balaam...', 'Pentateuch', 'Easy'),
('Where did Moses die?', ARRAY['In Egypt', 'In the Promised Land', 'On Mount Nebo', 'In the Red Sea'], 'On Mount Nebo', 'Deuteronomy 34:1-5 - Moses climbed Mount Nebo... There Moses the servant of the Lord died.', 'Pentateuch', 'Medium'),
